      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To complete the task, I need to create a Python script that retrieves and parses a JSON-formatted secret from a concrete external provider. I will use AWS Secrets Manager as the external provider because it is a widely used service for managing secrets. The script will import the necessary AWS SDK (Boto3) and use it to interact with the Secrets Manager service. </thinking>\n",
